"text": "The balance sheet shows equity at 12.5. That is ignored: for listed equity, use market value."}]}]}}, "index": "aCEQj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 570, "y": 1419.199999999997, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-3b", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-2v", "props": {"w": 490, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Market rates go down", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bond prices go "}, {"type": "text", "text": "up", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aGvrf", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 491, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-4c", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-44", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 264, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Coupon floats", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Floating rate bond", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Coupon reset to a benchmark (inflation, inter-bank or call rates), typically every 6 months. Lower rate risk. Good when rates are rising. Limits: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "cap", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (maximum) and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "floor", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (minimum). Inverse floaters move opposite to the benchmark."}]}]}}, "index": "a8TzH", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-5d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-5b", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "All exam traps in this chapter"}]}]}}, "index": "a2682", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 5680, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-6e", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A point the exam likes to twist"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aENPA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 301.3573573573574, "y": 573, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-3", "props": {"w": 376.8048048048048, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "As long as the company needs it"}]}]}}, "index": "aDUZm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1626, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-1a", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-t", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Book value per share", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = net worth (equity capital plus reserves) ÷ number of shares outstanding. Assets sit in the books at cost less depreciation. Their real selling value may be different, and is never known for sure."}]}]}}, "index": "aHQkA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 539, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-2b", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch03-1v", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EXAM TRAP", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cash is "}, {"type": "text", "text": "subtracted", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " in EV, not added. The book's sample question: market cap 10 lakh, debt 3 lakh, cash 4 lakh. EV = 10 + 3 − 4 = "}, {"type": "text", "text": "9 lakh", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 72, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aDTIv", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 1084, "y": 1419.199999999997, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-3c", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch03-2v", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your bond pays 10%. New bonds now pay 12%. Nobody will pay full price for your 10% bond when 12% is on offer. To sell it, you must cut the price until the buyer's return matches 12%."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 144, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.3, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aH3cA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 779, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-4d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-44", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Principal becomes shares", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Convertible bond", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Debt that can turn into equity. Lower coupon than plain debt. Issuer need not repay. But existing owners are diluted and "}, {"type": "text", "text": "EPS falls", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "a9EZn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 138.8000000000029, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-5e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-5b", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "m", "w": 1128, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Read these the night before. Each one is a question waiting to happen"}]}]}}, "index": "a36Uy", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-6f", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "An everyday picture of the idea"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aFvQz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 686.1621621621622, "y": 573, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-h", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-3", "props": {"w": 373.83783783783787, "h": 78, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Must be repaid after a fixed time"}]}]}}, "index": "aE8Fb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1730, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-1b", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-t", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Intrinsic value versus market price"}]}]}}, "index": "aIDTn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 932.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-2c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-1v", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Earnings: which profit, which period?"}]}]}}, "index": "aEsYn", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1892.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-3d", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-2v", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Redemption", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": at maturity the issuer repays the principal and the final coupon. The bond then ceases to exist."}]}]}}, "index": "aIXGb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 779, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-4e", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-44", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Principal protected", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Principal protected note (PPN)", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Part goes into debt that grows back to the principal. The rest goes into equity, derivatives or commodities for upside. A synthetic product. Still carries the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "issuer's credit risk", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}}, "index": "aAI9v", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-5f", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch03-5b", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "1.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Dividend % is on "}, {"type": "text", "text": "face value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". 30% on Rs 2 face value = Rs 0.60."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a4V9n", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6640, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-6g", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "light-blue", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "WHY IT MATTERS", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The reason behind a rule"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aGDXr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 659, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-i", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-3", "props": {"w": 237.3573573573574, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Return", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aFsNE", "typeName": "shape"}, {"name": "", "color": "#39B178", "imageUrl": "", "meta": {}, "id": "user:mIaWuZv6EKUoe9zO8T3mb", "typeName": "user"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1805, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-1c", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-t", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "m", "w": 1288, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Intrinsic value", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " is the present value of the expected free cash flows from an asset. Warren Buffett calls it \"the discounted value of the cash that can be taken out of a business during its remaining life\". The discount rate used is usually the investor's required return, adjusted for the risks of the business. Later chapters show how."}]}]}}, "index": "aJYrr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1007.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-2d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-1v", "props": {"w": 1288, "h": 294, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Net profit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Profit left for the equity owners."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBIT", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Earnings before interest and taxes. To be shared among lenders, government and owners."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "EBITDA", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Earnings before interest, tax, depreciation and amortisation. First recovers the capital spent on assets, then is shared among lenders, government and owners."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Historical", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Earnings of past years."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Trailing", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": The most recent period up to now, on a rolling basis. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "TTM", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " = trailing twelve months. Also trailing 4 quarters. Useful when valuing a company in the middle of a year."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Forward", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": Earnings projected from future revenue and cost estimates."}]}]}]}]}}, "index": "aF45n", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1950.3999999999942, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-3e", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-2v", "props": {"w": 1288, "h": 144, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Interactive tool on the web page: Bond calculator", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Face value Rs 100, coupon paid once a year. Move the sliders."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Open this chapter's study page to try it."}]}]}}, "index": "aJkPI", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1007, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-4f", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-44", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Linked to inflation", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Inflation protected securities", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Principal and coupon adjusted for inflation, so the real return is protected. Helps retired investors most."}]}]}}, "index": "aBjnA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-5g", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch03-5b", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Split lowers face value; consolidation raises it. 1 share of Rs 10 split into 5 = 5 shares of Rs 2."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5MzJ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 7120, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-6h", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "yellow", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "REMEMBER", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A number or date to learn. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Highlighted", "marks": [{"type": "highlight"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " text means the same."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aH1ZU", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 301.3573573573574, "y": 659, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-j", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-3", "props": {"w": 376.8048048048048, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "No fixed return. Gets the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "residual profit", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", whatever is left"}]}]}}, "index": "aGzKm", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1927, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-1d", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-t", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 114, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "green", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Intrinsic value > market price", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The share is "}, {"type": "text", "text": "undervalued", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". A buy candidate."}]}]}}, "index": "aKKTM", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 1341.5999999999985, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-2e", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch03-1v", "props": {"color": "violet", "size": "l", "w": 1288, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Per-share numbers and price ratios"}]}]}}, "index": "aGXUzV", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 3080, "y": 3078.999999999994, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-3f", "type": "frame", "props": {"w": 1400, "h": 2913.199999999997, "name": "3.2 Debt words (2 of 2)", "color": "black"}, "parentId": "page:page", "index": "a5vjr", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 1007, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-4g", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-44", "props": {"w": 632, "h": 204, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "draw", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "m", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Different currency", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Foreign currency bond", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Issued in a currency other than the issuer's home currency, such as USD. Lower rates, but the "}, {"type": "text", "text": "issuer", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " carries currency risk."}]}]}}, "index": "aCr3Q", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 712, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-5h", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch03-5b", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "3.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Intrinsic value above market price = undervalued. Below = overvalued."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a6rGQ", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 5680, "y": 500.00000000000006, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-6i", "type": "text", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "grey", "size": "l", "w": 1342.857142857143, "font": "sans", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.4, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Frames read top to bottom, then left to right. Zoom into one frame at a time."}]}]}}, "index": "aI5Gj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 686.1621621621622, "y": 659, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch03-k", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch03-3", "props": {"w": 373.83783783783787, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fixed interest, plus principal back at maturity"}]}]}}, "index": "aHk92", "typeName": "shape"}]}